Folder Structure Setup

ai-job-platform/
│
├── client/                     # Frontend App (React.js + Tailwind CSS)
│
├── server/                     # Backend App (Node.js + Express + MongoDB)
│   ├── config/
│   │   ├── db.js               # Database Connection
│   │   └── cloudinary.js       # Cloudinary Integration Config
│   ├── controllers/
│   │   ├── authController.js   # Auth Logic (Register, Login, Me, etc.)
│   │   └── userController.js   # Profile & User Management
│   ├── middleware/
│   │   ├── authMiddleware.js   # JWT verification & Role guards
│   │   └── errorMiddleware.js  # Global error handler
│   ├── models/
│   │   ├── User.js             # User Schema
│   │   ├── CandidateProfile.js # Candidate Profile Schema
│   │   └── EmployerProfile.js  # Employer Profile Schema
│   ├── routes/
│   │   ├── authRoutes.js       # Authentication Endpoints
│   │   └── userRoutes.js       # User Management Endpoints
│   ├── utils/
│   │   └── generateToken.js    # JWT Generator helper
│   ├── validators/
│   │   └── authValidator.js    # Input Validations (Zod/Joi)
│   ├── .env.example            # Environment variables format
│   ├── package.json
│   └── server.js               # Main Backend Server Entry
│
├── .gitignore
└── README.md